# Files only the owner may change (docs/CI.md, "Protected files"):
#   - a pull request touching them needs @rishigoswamy's review (branch protection: "Require review from Code Owners");
#   - the pipeline's stage 1 fails if anyone else brings them onto main or a release tag (scripts/protected.js).
# GitHub reads this file from main, so a pull request can't change who reviews itself; and owners need write access.
# Games, pages, styles, other docs and individual tests are open: ordinary development.

# This list, the pipeline and releases
/.github/                    @rishigoswamy

# The quality gate: its rules, the checks, the test runner and the shared test helpers
/coverage-thresholds.json    @rishigoswamy
/scripts/                    @rishigoswamy
/test/e2e/run.js             @rishigoswamy
/test/e2e/helpers.js         @rishigoswamy
/test/e2e/party-setup.js     @rishigoswamy
/test/unit/helpers.js        @rishigoswamy
/docs/CI.md                  @rishigoswamy

# Dependencies: a package runs its code on every host's computer and in the pipeline
/package.json                @rishigoswamy
/package-lock.json           @rishigoswamy

# Code that runs on the host's computer, and the security-sensitive parts of the game
/server/                     @rishigoswamy
/Start*.command              @rishigoswamy
/public/js/lib/admin-lock.js @rishigoswamy
/public/sw.js                @rishigoswamy
